<title>USA: Aavid Thermal raises prices by 6 percent.</title>
<headline>Aavid Thermal raises prices by 6 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LACONIA, N.H. 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aavid Thermal Technologies Inc on Monday said it will raise prices for thermal management products by an average of 6 percent, effective May 1, 1997.</p>
<p>The company did not detail the prices for any of its products.</p>
<p>Aavid Thermal Technologies provides thermal management products to the power and digital electronics industries.</p>
